a Pradesh coastline by Wednesday morning. The India Meteorological Department has issued alerts for severe winds and torrential rainfall affecting multiple states. Emergency shelters and control rooms are set up as beach access is prohibited to ensure public safety. Heavy rains are also impacting Odisha and Jharkhand. Residents are urged to stay updated and minimize travel during the cyclone's effects.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-named-cyclone-arnab-and-why-where-it-will-hit-states-on-alert-and-preparedness/articleshow/135226544.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-named-cyclone-arnab-and-why-where-it-will-hit-states-on-alert-and-preparedness/articleshow/135226544.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T12:46:13+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135227447,imgsize-66484.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC seeks Centre’s response to media body’s plea challenging data protection act]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-seeks-centres-response-to-media-bodys-plea-challenging-data-protection-law/articleshow/135227340.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135227340.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-seeks-centres-response-to-media-bodys-plea-challenging-data-protection-law/articleshow/135227340.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-seeks-centres-response-to-media-bodys-plea-challenging-data-protection-law/articleshow/135227340.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T12:43:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135227396,imgsize-55112.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA